    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15722" root="رضح" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَضْحٌ</span></b>  inf. n. of 1. (S, L, Msb.) [Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَوَى</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الرَّضْحِ</span> <i>Date-stones that fall out from others</i> [<i>in
the operation of breaking</i> or <i>bruising</i>]. (S, K.)
And ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَضْحَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A date-stone that flies from beneath
the stone</i> [called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِرْضَاح</span>]. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, [or
perhaps more properly with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خ</span>,] <i>A small gift.</i>
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>A little of news</i> or <i>tidings.</i> (TA.)

